WEBVTT

00:12.490 --> 00:14.810
The Haltina Sea of Trees
we're headed to now...

00:14.810 --> 00:18.540
...is spread across the far east area of
the continent, and is home to beastmen.

00:19.020 --> 00:23.250
Deep in the forest, there's a nation
founded by beastmen, Verbergen.

00:23.650 --> 00:26.800
Although,
we Haulias are banned from entering.

00:26.800 --> 00:28.300
But why?

00:28.300 --> 00:31.580
In Verbergen,
Haulias are considered sinful.

00:31.580 --> 00:35.060
The Elders's meeting once
settled on our execution.

00:35.060 --> 00:36.910
Execution?!

00:37.580 --> 00:39.140
Don't worry.

00:39.140 --> 00:41.470
Now that they have recognised us
as Boss' relatives,

00:41.470 --> 00:43.780
the sentence has been lifted.

00:43.780 --> 00:46.320
Um, what's the Elders' meeting?

00:46.700 --> 00:50.810
It's a meeting of each clan's representative
to discuss matters.

00:51.180 --> 00:55.310
So it's like a nation's
highest decision-making body?

00:55.310 --> 00:59.230
Yes. Should you wish to negotiate,
speak with one of the Elders,

00:59.230 --> 01:01.710
Ulfric, in person.

01:05.000 --> 01:11.630
ARIFURETA - FROM COMMONPLACE
TO WORLD'S STRONGEST SEASON 3

02:34.010 --> 02:39.010
THE HERO RETURNS

02:49.520 --> 02:51.290
Hey, Hajime Nagumo.

02:51.290 --> 02:52.030
Huh?

02:52.750 --> 02:56.050
Could you get me one of these vehicles?

02:56.050 --> 02:57.330
In your dreams.

02:57.330 --> 03:01.620
It's obvious you lent a hand to the Haulias.

03:01.620 --> 03:03.250
You could at least do me a favour...

03:03.250 --> 03:04.540
I don't care.

03:04.540 --> 03:06.430
I'll pay any asking price.

03:06.430 --> 03:10.880
Should you fancy some women,
one of my daughters is of ripe age.

03:10.880 --> 03:12.340
Trying to show your might?

03:12.340 --> 03:13.820
Allow me to crush this man.

03:13.820 --> 03:15.970
Is he joking? Is he?

03:16.360 --> 03:19.220
Please don't consider yourself the same
as Nagumo, Your Highness.

03:19.220 --> 03:22.220
No! You can't do that!

03:23.870 --> 03:24.650
Huh?

03:25.150 --> 03:26.590
I mean, I hate the idea.

03:26.590 --> 03:31.280
By the way, I saw you
enjoy dancing without Baius.

03:31.280 --> 03:35.340
I'm not in that kind of relationship
with Mister Nagumo?!

03:35.340 --> 03:37.240
Isn't that right?

03:37.240 --> 03:40.590
Even if the world turns upside down,
it's just impossible.

03:40.590 --> 03:42.490
You don't have to go that far...

03:42.490 --> 03:45.750
Besides, the princess is already
someone else's wife, right?

03:45.750 --> 03:48.220
About that...

03:48.220 --> 03:51.790
To be honest, my family
thinks it's not time for that.

03:52.320 --> 03:57.490
If they say a Kingdom princess shouldn't
marry someone whose death we don't know,

03:57.490 --> 03:59.300
I won't be able to rebut at all.

03:59.990 --> 04:03.040
Also, our labour force has been
decreasing by freeing the slaves.

04:03.040 --> 04:07.810
To be honest, the Empire is in a situation
to beg for the Kingdom's help.

04:07.810 --> 04:09.410
I see.

04:09.410 --> 04:13.070
So the princess' marriage
has been completely cancelled?

04:13.070 --> 04:15.320
Good for you, Lily!

04:15.320 --> 04:16.800
You're right.

04:16.800 --> 04:19.920
While you might not be able to
love anyone you want to,

04:19.920 --> 04:21.700
you've got yourself some time for now.

04:21.700 --> 04:24.160
Yeah. Great for you, Lily.

04:24.500 --> 04:25.740
Thanks...

04:25.740 --> 04:30.030
With that said,
Princess Liliana is free now.

04:30.030 --> 04:32.590
Hajime Nagumo, you have my support
if you want to marry her.

04:32.590 --> 04:34.420
Your Majesty!

04:34.420 --> 04:38.190
- What are you saying?!
- So you want the flying boat out of this favour?

04:38.190 --> 04:40.410
It won't do me any good.

04:40.410 --> 04:42.430
In fact, I'll lose something.

04:42.430 --> 04:45.430
- Hey, she's a princess, you know?
- What do you mean, Mister Nagumo?!

04:45.430 --> 04:49.440
- Right now, I don't have any wish.
- Don't ignore me, will you!

04:49.860 --> 04:52.790
No one will ever listen to me...

04:52.790 --> 04:55.130
Rather, they're not interested in me...

04:55.570 --> 04:57.440
What even being a princess is for...

04:58.610 --> 05:00.160
Just be honest.

05:00.610 --> 05:03.870
A human always has a wish.

05:10.410 --> 05:14.420
My wish is already in my arms.

05:14.980 --> 05:17.310
What do you want me
to ask for again?

05:26.220 --> 05:27.680
So cruel...

05:27.680 --> 05:30.080
It is forbidden to set fire to the forest.

05:30.080 --> 05:32.710
Yeah, my bad.

05:38.310 --> 05:39.900
What's that?

05:39.900 --> 05:41.450
A new monster?

06:04.220 --> 06:05.600
Mom!

06:32.350 --> 06:34.050
Hajime Nagumo.

06:34.050 --> 06:37.560
You've made quite a flashy entrance...

06:38.750 --> 06:41.710
Well, it was a pain in many ways...

06:41.710 --> 06:43.230
Could you let this one slide?

06:43.650 --> 06:45.850
Hey, can I leave it to you, Kaori?

06:45.850 --> 06:46.760
Sure.

06:51.270 --> 06:52.640
Tetragrammaton.

07:17.790 --> 07:20.160
It's a miracle...

07:20.160 --> 07:21.290
Is she a goddess?

07:21.290 --> 07:24.800
Yeah, she must be
the Protector Goddess of Verbergen!

07:27.300 --> 07:30.680
Hey, stop that! Please don't!

07:30.680 --> 07:33.280
The goddess has appeared again...

07:33.280 --> 07:35.690
On such a monotheistic land,

07:35.690 --> 07:39.230
I cannot believe there can be
many gods appearing here and there.

07:39.230 --> 07:43.280
That's a style of picking up
a fight with God upfront.

07:43.280 --> 07:44.530
I think it's good.

07:44.530 --> 07:46.200
Me too!

07:46.200 --> 07:48.590
Kaori, you've grown so well.

07:48.590 --> 07:51.450
Shizushizu, you sound like her mom.

07:56.720 --> 07:57.710
Sir Nagumo.

07:58.210 --> 08:00.080
Our comrades have been freed.

08:00.410 --> 08:04.460
Allow me to thank you
on behalf of Verbergen.

08:04.910 --> 08:09.940
And for rescuing my granddaughter,
Altina, as well.

08:10.810 --> 08:13.110
It's the Haulias who did it.

08:13.550 --> 08:15.220
Don't mistake that.

08:15.780 --> 08:18.340
I've heard it from our rescued comrades,

08:18.340 --> 08:22.420
but I can't believe the supposedly weakest
of rabbitmen could take down the Empire...

08:29.290 --> 08:31.240
I guess one should strive to live longer.

08:31.700 --> 08:36.500
Perhaps I am now in a historical moment.

08:50.930 --> 08:53.580
Father? What are you...

08:55.270 --> 08:57.430
Hear me, Haulias!

08:57.430 --> 08:59.260
For a long time,

08:59.260 --> 09:03.070
we have gasped in a sea of humiliation
and resignation, my comrades.

09:03.470 --> 09:06.440
But now, we have claimed victory
against the Empire.

09:06.830 --> 09:09.770
But there is no eternal peace.

09:09.770 --> 09:15.350
Your future will soon
be threatened again.

09:16.610 --> 09:21.430
When that happens, you will all return
to what you were yesterday.

09:21.870 --> 09:23.440
Not just that.

09:23.830 --> 09:27.900
The comrades who protected the slaves
will face the same thing as them.

09:29.450 --> 09:31.460
Are you okay with that?

09:33.210 --> 09:35.070
Of course you aren't.

09:35.070 --> 09:37.340
Then, what should we do?

09:37.730 --> 09:38.930
It's simple.

09:39.520 --> 09:42.860
If you want to protect those precious
right next to you now...

09:44.070 --> 09:44.980
Then fight.

09:46.150 --> 09:47.480
If you don't want...

09:47.480 --> 09:51.120
...to be exploited and live in resignation,

09:51.120 --> 09:52.490
then stand up!

09:52.870 --> 09:56.090
If you want to change
the rabbitmen's circumstances,

09:56.090 --> 09:58.510
then fill your hearts with anger!

10:00.000 --> 10:03.170
The rabbitmen are not the weakest race!

10:03.800 --> 10:08.000
We can be even stronger
with determination!

10:08.000 --> 10:12.010
The Haulias, one of rabbitmen tribes,
have proved that!

10:12.510 --> 10:14.720
We will teach you how to fight!

10:15.120 --> 10:17.950
The Haulias always welcome you anytime!

10:23.750 --> 10:24.530
Boss.

10:25.690 --> 10:27.920
Sorry for interrupting you.

10:28.420 --> 10:31.460
It was perfect timing
for a recruitment chance.

10:31.460 --> 10:32.780
Yeah...

10:32.780 --> 10:37.280
And just like this, the kind rabbitmen
of the forest was annihilated.

10:37.280 --> 10:39.290
Cut it out, Miss Yue!

10:39.970 --> 10:43.570
So you're saying there'll
be more of Haulias?

10:50.000 --> 10:52.800
You act bold for a leader
of a ruined country!

10:53.360 --> 10:55.950
Do you really think you
can go back that easily?!

10:55.950 --> 10:59.610
You must not think
you're able to kill me, right?

10:59.610 --> 11:04.310
That means, the Elders of Verbergen
are a bunch of idiots.

11:04.310 --> 11:05.420
Say what?!

11:05.420 --> 11:07.040
Hold it, Zel.

11:07.040 --> 11:11.210
Don't forget that Gahard's here
to prove what the Haulias did to us,

11:11.210 --> 11:15.210
and also the effect of the vow, or else.

11:17.820 --> 11:21.140
Gahard, you will behave now.

11:24.350 --> 11:26.330
Then, take up your sword.

11:26.820 --> 11:31.960
We, the Empire, only show respect
to those we deem strong.

11:32.290 --> 11:37.220
If you're unhappy with how I act,
then make me obey you with force.

11:38.400 --> 11:41.140
I didn't lose against you beastmen.

11:41.140 --> 11:44.080
It's not you I should show respect to.

11:44.080 --> 11:46.270
The ones who fought
and risked their lives,

11:46.270 --> 11:49.400
to show their strength on
the battlefield were the Haulias.

11:58.160 --> 11:59.690
Hey, Gahard.

11:59.690 --> 12:00.570
Hm?

12:00.570 --> 12:03.020
You're a pain in my butt,
so just go back, will you?

12:03.020 --> 12:03.730
What?

12:07.050 --> 12:11.460
Hey! Are you trying to send me
back to the Empire now?!

12:12.270 --> 12:16.320
This is a monumental meeting between
two countries in some ways!

12:16.320 --> 12:20.720
You two have had different values,
and grudges with each other for centuries,

12:20.720 --> 12:25.770
and you expect those to be changed
through this one small talk?

12:25.770 --> 12:28.190
You have a point...

12:28.190 --> 12:32.690
Therefore, you should go back home
before you start any trouble.

12:32.690 --> 12:33.460
You brat!

12:33.460 --> 12:36.350
- Don't treat me like I'm some rebelling kid!
- Now His Majesty will understand how I feel.

12:36.350 --> 12:38.700
- Let me go!
- Now His Majesty will understand how I feel.

12:38.700 --> 12:40.110
You'll pay for this!

12:40.110 --> 12:40.550
Whoop.

12:40.550 --> 12:43.450
Hajime Nagumo!

12:44.950 --> 12:49.460
Hang on!
I still have my work as the princess!

12:49.460 --> 12:51.580
Oh, fine.

12:51.990 --> 12:54.530
We'll take our break now.

12:54.530 --> 12:56.710
Come find me when you're done.

12:56.710 --> 12:58.390
Okay.

12:59.720 --> 13:03.590
Cam, I'd like you to take us
to your settlement,

13:03.990 --> 13:07.810
but I'm too tired to drive Fernir
to carry thousands of people.

13:07.810 --> 13:09.350
I'll have someone take you there.

13:09.810 --> 13:11.450
Wait, Nagumo.

13:11.910 --> 13:14.360
We still haven't come up
with a way to reward you.

13:14.360 --> 13:16.560
Could you bear with us for a bit more?

13:16.560 --> 13:19.630
I told you, it's the Haulias
who got the job done.

13:19.630 --> 13:22.610
Of course, we will reward them
properly as well.

13:23.040 --> 13:26.120
However, it remains true
that we are still indebted to you.

13:26.120 --> 13:31.360
Well, if you want to pay back the favour,
feel free to do so.

13:31.360 --> 13:34.130
But right now, I don't have any wish.

13:34.530 --> 13:38.960
Then, at least allow us to provide hospitality
during your stay in the Sea of Trees.

13:39.580 --> 13:42.740
Altina also wants to thank you.

13:49.550 --> 13:52.480
If that's what you want,
then I'll be in your care.

13:55.570 --> 13:56.930
All right, Cam.

13:57.350 --> 14:00.240
You destroyed the invaders,
despite being exiled,

14:00.240 --> 14:04.770
and also made the Empire swear a vow,
and released our comrades.

14:05.240 --> 14:08.650
We must reward you with something.

14:09.130 --> 14:14.470
At present, no one is against
the cancellation of the Haulias' exile.

14:14.960 --> 14:18.430
This is the decision made
in the Elders' meeting right after the siege.

14:18.940 --> 14:20.010
I see.

14:20.010 --> 14:21.380
Thus,

14:21.380 --> 14:25.930
as a reward for you, Cam,
the chieftain of Haulia tribe,

14:25.930 --> 14:31.340
I propose the position
of an Elder to you.

14:32.330 --> 14:34.110
What about the other Elders?

14:36.710 --> 14:38.520
That's all, Cam.

14:38.520 --> 14:40.630
Will you take the position?

14:40.630 --> 14:41.940
Of course, no.

14:44.890 --> 14:46.710
Could I ask why?

14:46.710 --> 14:50.580
You're getting the wrong idea, anyway.

14:50.580 --> 14:51.660
Wrong idea?

14:51.970 --> 14:58.350
You thought we saved the whole beastmen,
but that was just an afterthought.

14:58.900 --> 15:01.920
The Haulias are not your allies at all.

15:02.620 --> 15:06.740
Should you cause trouble to us or Boss,

15:07.430 --> 15:11.180
our blades will be pointed
right at your throats.

15:11.180 --> 15:14.290
You're really going to do that
to your comrades?!

15:14.290 --> 15:18.780
Our blades are swung
for the future of rabbitmen.

15:19.250 --> 15:21.930
Just keep that in mind.

15:27.310 --> 15:29.410
Shea sure is late.

15:29.410 --> 15:32.740
She said she went to see her family.

15:32.740 --> 15:36.350
Is she celebrating
the victory with her tribe?

15:36.350 --> 15:40.070
Well, when it comes to her,
I am sure nothing bad will happen.

15:41.220 --> 15:43.800
Sorry to barge in late, Boss.

15:44.210 --> 15:45.530
What's up?

15:45.530 --> 15:48.510
I understand that you are resting now,

15:48.510 --> 15:51.040
but could you come with me
for a moment now?

15:51.040 --> 15:52.510
At this hour?

15:52.510 --> 15:53.560
Yes, please.

15:55.120 --> 15:56.060
Got it.

15:56.420 --> 15:57.970
I'm going too.

15:57.970 --> 15:59.310
Me too!

15:59.310 --> 16:01.320
Hiss!

16:12.230 --> 16:13.450
Mister Hajime!

16:14.870 --> 16:16.350
Was it Father?

16:16.350 --> 16:19.470
Yeah, he just went back earlier.

16:20.630 --> 16:23.340
So he can be pretty considerate.

16:24.100 --> 16:25.270
That your mother?

16:25.270 --> 16:26.540
Yes, it is.

16:26.540 --> 16:28.730
She's resting under this tree.

16:29.130 --> 16:30.270
I see.

16:31.350 --> 16:33.210
She wanted to be a hero.

16:33.990 --> 16:36.410
She wanted to be able to
protect her family.

16:36.860 --> 16:38.870
Not just run and hide.

16:38.870 --> 16:42.380
She wanted to face all who tried to
take away people dear to her,

16:42.380 --> 16:44.420
and protect them all.

16:44.420 --> 16:46.690
That's the hero she wanted to be.

16:47.440 --> 16:48.960
That's what she said.

16:49.430 --> 16:53.040
Her eyes were so full of bursting spirit.

16:53.040 --> 16:55.210
That's why you were born, huh?

17:00.730 --> 17:03.650
What you told me was true, Mother.

17:04.060 --> 17:08.900
The world might be so strict,
but it can sometimes be kind.

17:09.880 --> 17:12.080
I've found it.

17:12.500 --> 17:13.990
Let me introduce him.

17:14.400 --> 17:16.320
This is Mister Hajime Nagumo.

17:17.020 --> 17:19.070
Someone I hold dear.

17:19.890 --> 17:21.090
And also...

17:21.470 --> 17:25.170
Father, the Haulia tribe, and I,

17:25.600 --> 17:27.260
have become heroes.

17:28.030 --> 17:29.220
Thank you.

17:29.220 --> 17:29.900
Huh?

17:30.710 --> 17:32.120
Two of us started our journey

17:32.120 --> 17:35.890
after crawling out of the abyss,
ready if the whole world would be against us.

17:35.890 --> 17:37.570
Even if we had been alone,

17:38.100 --> 17:42.690
we were confident we could
overcome any obstacles.

17:43.920 --> 17:45.140
But I'm sure...

17:45.570 --> 17:47.770
...it wouldn't be as fun as now
if we did.

17:48.300 --> 17:52.530
The one who gave colours to Yue's
and my journey, hearts, way of life,

17:53.490 --> 17:57.430
is without a doubt your daughter.

17:59.980 --> 18:03.570
I thank you for bringing her to this world.

18:10.110 --> 18:12.170
Um, Mister Hajime...

18:13.020 --> 18:15.230
Thank you so much.

18:15.230 --> 18:18.650
I can't express my gratitude
with words alone...

18:20.370 --> 18:23.960
What should I do to return the favour?

18:23.960 --> 18:26.460
But I just accepted your gratitude earlier.

18:26.460 --> 18:29.510
That's just in words!

18:29.510 --> 18:33.030
I want to return the favour
in a more meaningful way!

18:33.840 --> 18:39.060
What should I do to make you happy?

18:39.060 --> 18:42.730
Should you wish for it,
I'll do anything.

18:43.480 --> 18:47.150
You should just smile
nonchalantly as always.

18:47.150 --> 18:49.070
You're our mood maker.

18:49.070 --> 18:51.990
What do you mean by that?

18:52.470 --> 18:55.940
I already told you,
I have got your gratitude.

18:56.370 --> 18:58.430
Too much of it, actually.

18:59.980 --> 19:01.950
It doesn't make sense.

19:03.470 --> 19:06.700
Mister Hajime,
come with me for a second!

19:11.850 --> 19:14.470
My mother was buried here,

19:14.470 --> 19:17.730
because this was her favourite place.

19:17.730 --> 19:20.760
I see. So it's like a secret base?

19:26.630 --> 19:28.560
What is it, Mister Hajime?

19:28.560 --> 19:33.150
If you keep staring,
I'll feel embarrassed...

19:33.150 --> 19:34.290
Hey, Shea.

19:34.780 --> 19:37.090
I have a favour to ask.

19:37.090 --> 19:38.970
Favour?

19:38.970 --> 19:42.460
Of course! Ask me anything!

19:42.460 --> 19:43.700
Well...

19:44.160 --> 19:46.290
I just feel like lying down.

19:46.710 --> 19:49.290
Could you lend me your lap?

19:49.710 --> 19:51.860
Okay, go ahead.

19:51.860 --> 19:53.300
Thanks.

19:58.690 --> 20:02.320
How long will you start falling for me?

20:02.320 --> 20:03.840
How about you give up?

20:03.840 --> 20:05.300
Nope.

20:05.300 --> 20:06.380
That so...

20:26.330 --> 20:28.880
They seem to be used to this.

20:29.350 --> 20:32.250
No wonder they keep fighting
with Yue every day.

20:32.250 --> 20:34.510
Their specs are off the charts.

20:34.510 --> 20:36.210
We can't afford to slack off here.

20:36.210 --> 20:40.720
That's not true.
I still can't beat Shea and Yue.

20:40.720 --> 20:46.570
Kaori, from my perspective, you're more like
a bug character than a cheat one.

20:46.570 --> 20:49.580
If I'm a bug character, then what
about Hajime and the others?

20:51.230 --> 20:52.880
Don't worry, Shizuku.

20:53.290 --> 20:57.170
If we can clear the Great Labyrinths,
we can be stronger.

20:57.170 --> 21:00.490
All right, I'm looking forward
to any new magic spells now!

21:00.490 --> 21:02.990
Let's do our best!

21:16.880 --> 21:18.480
This is...

21:18.480 --> 21:19.700
A big tree...

21:19.700 --> 21:20.790
So big...

21:20.790 --> 21:23.890
It sure is...

23:05.530 --> 23:08.630
Hajime, wake up already!

23:09.680 --> 23:13.970
He won't budge. Sorry for having
you do this every morning.

23:13.970 --> 23:15.620
Can I leave him to you?

23:22.250 --> 23:23.850
Wake up, Hajime.

23:26.750 --> 23:28.600
Morning, Yue.

23:29.060 --> 23:31.330
Morning, Hajime.

23:33.020 --> 23:34.900
HALTINA'S LABYRINTH

23:34.900 --> 23:37.710
HALTINA'S LABYRINTH
Next episode: Haltina's Labyrinth.

23:37.710 --> 23:41.310
HALTINA'S LABYRINTH
